# CRUD pattern

Copy the User resource end-to-end; do not invent a parallel structure.

## Backend

1. Model (prefer `IndexedTimeStampedModel`)
2. `makemigrations` / `migrate` via manage.py
3. Serializers (read + write; write-only secrets)
4. ViewSet with `IsAuthenticated` + model permissions including `view`
5. Register in app `routes.py`
6. Regenerate OpenAPI: `make schema`
7. pytest API E2E under `apps/<app>/tests/`; `make test` green

## Frontend

1. `yarn openapi-ts` from `react-boilerplate`
2. Feature hooks wrapping generated SDK
3. List / detail / create / edit pages under the authenticated shell
4. Gate actions with `<Can perm="...">` and route guards
5. Playwright under `e2e/` for list/create/permissions; `yarn test:e2e` green

See `../fullstack-bootstrap/specs/04-crud-pattern.md` for the full checklist.
